msgctxt "3852"
msgid ""
"This place sure has changed... Oh, I haven't told you. I used to work here "
"three years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3864"
msgid "So you took a break for a while?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3876"
msgid "Yeah. I decided to try working in Roppongi for a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3888"
msgid "What made you come back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3900"
msgid "Well, the club's been in a real tight spot lately, so the owner asked me to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3912"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3924"
msgid "Heheh. Guess they want me to turn this place around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3936"
msgid ""
"Though I'm not sure what anyone sees in me. It's hard enough readjusting to "
"a new environment, let alone dealing with all the pressure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3948"
msgid "Don't think too hard about it. You'll be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3960"
msgid ""
"And how would you know that? Do you even know what it took for me to make "
"that decision?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3972"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3984"
msgid "Don't just brush it off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3996"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4008"
msgid "They must really trust you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4020"
msgid "Yeah. The owner's always been really good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4032"
msgid "I guess there's just a lot riding on this decision, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4044"
msgid ""
"Even so, the fact that you were asked back is a good sign. They obviously "
"see something in you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4056"
msgid ""
"Mm, maybe so. Whenever I put my mind to something, I give it everything I "
"have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4068"
msgid "Guess I'll keep putting my best foot forward, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4080"
msgid "That's the spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4092"
msgid "No need to pressure yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4104"
msgid "Yeah. You're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4116"
msgid "After all, it was the owner who wanted me back here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4128"
msgid "Guess I can only do what I can, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4140"
msgid "Pretty much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4152"
msgid ""
"The way I am now is like night and day compared to the last time I worked "
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4164"
msgid "What were you like before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4176"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'd play the shy, innocent girl... Anytime a customer\r\n"
"wanted to drink with me, I'd pretend I was a lightweight...\r\n"
"Heheh. I was pretty naive back then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4188"
msgid "But it must've been fun to drink with you, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4200"
msgid ""
"Not really. I hardly knew my left from my right when I came out here. "
"Probably 'cause I was fresh out of Kyoto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4212"
msgid ""
"And since my personality was so bland, no one ever requested me. "
"Eventually, that impacted my performance and took a toll on my mental "
"health... I just felt so numb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4224"
msgid ""
"But then! Little did I know, one day, everything would change without "
"warning! Wanna know how it happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4236"
msgid "I got mugged, Kiryu-san! In Kamurocho, of all places!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4248"
msgid "Go figure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4260"
msgid ""
"So I was minding my own business, when all of a sudden, I felt myself go "
"down! Then my purse got yanked away! Turns out someone hit me... Happened "
"too fast to notice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4272"
msgid ""
"That thief, whoever it was, tried to make off with my wallet, but he didn't "
"get very far. He got chased down by a paperboy who happened to be nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4284"
msgid ""
"Oh, and you would not believe how livid I was. I was ready to punch this "
"thieving jerkface into oblivion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4296"
msgid ""
"So that's what I ended up doing. ♪ Knocked a couple teeth out, too. Even "
"the paperboy was impressed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4308"
msgid "Weren't you scared?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4320"
msgid ""
"Not at all. It was like something powerful came over me...\r\n"
"Next thing I knew, I had pulverized that stupid little punk!\r\n"
"Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4332"
msgid "Oh. Crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4344"
msgid ""
"But you know... If it weren't for you, Kiryu-san, I never would've had that "
"much courage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4356"
msgid "...What did I do, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4368"
msgid ""
"Oh, just seeing you romp around town was enough to inspire me. Who wouldn't "
"wanna live life to the fullest after witnessing all that butt-kicking? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4380"
msgid "Oh yeah! There was also a guy in a yellow helmet, too! I liked his style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4392"
msgid "That's gotta be Majima-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4404"
msgid ""
"So yeah. When I saw you out there punching, kicking, and repeatedly bashing "
"your problems in the face, it made my troubles seem small in comparison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4416"
msgid "After that, I was able to shake off all that negativity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4428"
msgid ""
"I realized I didn't have to be a character to please people. And sure "
"enough, my performance at the club started going up... because I was "
"finally able to enjoy it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4440"
msgid "That's quite a change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4452"
msgid "Oh, well, I didn't exactly change, per se."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4464"
msgid "I just went back to the way I was before. Rather, the way I really am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4476"
msgid "Heh. That's good to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4488"
msgid "Anyway, you could say I'm here now all because of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4500"
msgid ""
"So when I finally sat next to you, my heart started beating out of "
"control... For a moment, I thought I might pass out! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4512"
msgid "Heh. Am I that scary?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4524"
msgid "Nice going! You really went after him, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4536"
msgid ""
"I did! Normally you'd just let some crook like that get away, right? But "
"not me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4548"
msgid "Heh. That's very bold of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4560"
msgid ""
"You're the one who inspired me, Kiryu-san. If it weren't for you, I never "
"would've had that much courage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4572"
msgid "...What exactly did I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4584"
msgid ""
"Oh, just seeing you romp around town was enough to inspire me. Who wouldn't "
"wanna live life to the fullest after witnessing all that butt-kicking? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4596"
msgid "Oh yeah! There was also a guy in a yellow helmet, too! I liked his style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4608"
msgid "That's gotta be Majima-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4620"
msgid ""
"So yeah. When I saw you out there punching, kicking, and repeatedly bashing "
"your problems in the face, it made my troubles seem small in comparison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4632"
msgid "After that, I was able to shake off all that negativity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4644"
msgid ""
"I realized I didn't have to be a character to please people. And sure "
"enough, my performance at the club started going up... because I was "
"finally able to enjoy it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4656"
msgid "That's quite a change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4668"
msgid "Oh, well, I didn't exactly change, per se."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4680"
msgid "I just went back to the way I was before. Rather, the way I really am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4692"
msgid "So I guess, in retrospect, this might not have been such a bad thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4704"
msgid "That's a good way of looking at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4716"
msgid "Anyway, you could say I'm here now all because of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4728"
msgid ""
"So when I finally sat next to you, my heart started beating out of "
"control... For a moment, I thought I might pass out! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4740"
msgid "Heh. Am I that scary?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4752"
msgid "Hey now, it's not good to be so reckless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4764"
msgid ""
"Heheh. I know. That's not something an ordinary girl would do. Then again, "
"I'm no ordinary girl! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4776"
msgid "Apparently not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4788"
msgid ""
"But you know... If it weren't for you, Kiryu-san, I never would've had that "
"much courage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4800"
msgid "...What exactly did I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4812"
msgid ""
"Oh, just seeing you romp around town was enough to inspire me. Who wouldn't "
"wanna live life to the fullest after witnessing all that butt-kicking? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4824"
msgid "Oh yeah! There was also a guy in a yellow helmet, too! I liked his style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4836"
msgid "That's gotta be Majima-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4848"
msgid ""
"So yeah. When I saw you out there punching, kicking, and repeatedly bashing "
"your problems in the face, it made my troubles seem small in comparison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4860"
msgid "After that, I was able to shake off all that negativity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4872"
msgid ""
"I realized I didn't have to be a character to please people. And sure "
"enough, my performance at the club started going up... because I was "
