msgstr ""

msgctxt "4884"
msgid "That's quite a change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4896"
msgid "Oh, well, I didn't exactly change, per se."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4908"
msgid "I just went back to the way I was before. Rather, the way I really am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4920"
msgid "So I guess, in retrospect, this might not have been such a bad thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4932"
msgid "That's a good way of looking at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4944"
msgid "Anyway, you could say I'm here now all because of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4956"
msgid ""
"So when I finally sat next to you, my heart started beating out of "
"control... For a moment, I thought I might pass out! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4968"
msgid "Heh. Am I that scary?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4980"
msgid "Oooh... My shoulders have been feeling so tense lately..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4992"
msgid "Working hard, I imagine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5004"
msgid "Yeah, too hard! Sometimes I just wanna drop on the spot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5016"
msgid "That's not good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5028"
msgid ""
"Oh, I probably should've mentioned, I also run a company on the side. Does "
"that provide more context?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5040"
msgid "Whoa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5052"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa\" is right. I work both day and night, too, so it's like I'm working "
"two days at a time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5064"
msgid "What kind of company would require that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5076"
msgid "Hmm, how should I put it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5088"
msgid ""
"It's a company that handles anything and everything a girl would need to "
"make herself as cute as humanly possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5100"
msgid "Okay. Like a fashion company, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5112"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it started as my own little creative venture. But sooner or later, I "
"realized there were some gaps in the market that only I knew how to fill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5124"
msgid ""
"So I'll either come up with an idea myself, or me and my staff find local "
"artists and designers to collab with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5136"
msgid "Sounds engaging."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5148"
msgid "It is. And it finally feels like things are going at an even pace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5160"
msgid "Though we still have a long way to go! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5172"
msgid "Still, that's impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5184"
msgid "Heheh, you really think so? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5196"
msgid "Yeah, I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5208"
msgid ""
"I've been thinking lately... that I should be more grateful to everyone "
"around me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5220"
msgid "I couldn't have done all this by myself, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5232"
msgid "It never hurts to take a step back and thank the people who support you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5244"
msgid "How long ago did you start?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5256"
msgid "Maybe a year and a half ago?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5268"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5280"
msgid ""
"Lately, I've been thinking... I should be more grateful to everyone around "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5292"
msgid "I couldn't have done all this by myself, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5304"
msgid "It never hurts to take a step back and thank the people who support you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5316"
msgid "Don't break yourself over it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5328"
msgid "Heheh, I know, right? I was waiting for someone to tell me that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5340"
msgid "Yeah. It's important to stay balanced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5352"
msgid ""
"Lately, I've been thinking... I should be more grateful to everyone around "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5364"
msgid "I couldn't have done all this by myself, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5376"
msgid "It never hurts to take a step back and thank the people who support you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5388"
msgid "So there's this guy I've been going out with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5400"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5412"
msgid "But he's been acting pretty strange lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5424"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5436"
msgid "Mmm, it's like... I dunno, everything he does is super shady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5448"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5460"
msgid ""
"For example, he never picks up my calls or replies to my texts. At least "
"not immediately. And whenever I call him out on it, he'll say it's 'cause "
"of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5472"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5484"
msgid ""
"Did I mention he works at <Italic>my</Italic> company? So any extra work "
"would've had to have gone through me, which it hasn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5496"
msgid "Is that not incredibly suspicious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5508"
msgid "It sure sounds suspicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5520"
msgid "Right!? If even you're acknowledging it, then something's definitely up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5532"
msgid "Hey, I wouldn't go that far just yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5544"
msgid ""
"Too late! I've already decided⑬I'm throwing that jerk in the trash where he "
"belongs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5556"
msgid "Why don't you talk to him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5568"
msgid "Not gonna happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5580"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5592"
msgid ""
"He's too good at talking his way out of things... so he'll probably just "
"win me over somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5604"
msgid ""
"And even if I did talk to him, whenever he's put in a bad position, he "
"snaps. It's like handling a cornered animal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5616"
msgid "That's not a good sign."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5628"
msgid ""
"If he really is up to something, I'm throwing him out with the trash... "
"where he belongs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5640"
msgid "Maybe you should trick him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5652"
msgid "...What do you suggest?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5664"
msgid ""
"Maybe you can say one of your \"friends\" saw him walking with \"another "
"girl\" and get him to confess. See where I'm going with this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5676"
msgid "Hey, that's not a bad idea at all! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5688"
msgid "How did you come up with that, anyway? You ever get caught red-handed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5700"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5712"
msgid "Still waiting on that answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5724"
msgid "No, but it happened to a friend of mine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5736"
msgid "Hmm. I'll bet your \"friend\" had it pretty rough, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5748"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5760"
msgid "Reimi. Tell me if I'm wrong, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5772"
msgid "But what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5784"
msgid "I get the sense that you're pretty popular with the guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5796"
msgid "Whoa! Where's this coming from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5808"
msgid "Nothing, just a guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5820"
msgid "Well. Guys do tend to like me, at least when they first meet me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5832"
msgid "Then what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5844"
msgid "Then they start backtracking, once they actually get to know me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5856"
msgid ""
"\"Sorry, but I see you as more of a friend.\" I get that sorta BS all the "
"time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5868"
msgid "Hey, it happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5880"
msgid "Maybe guys want a more \"girly girl\" instead? What do you think, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5892"
msgid "Sounds about right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5904"
msgid "Well, that sucks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5916"
msgid ""
"If I'm just gonna get typecast from the beginning, then what's the point of "
"going out at all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5928"
msgid ""
"Besides, it's not like I can force myself to fit someone's image. That's "
"just wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5940"
msgid "...Yeah, I'd have to agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5952"
msgid "Are you really that masculine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5964"
msgid ""
"Apparently. I mean, that's not how I would describe myself, but... what do "
"I know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5976"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5988"
msgid "Types don't matter to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6000"
msgid "Not even a little bit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6012"
msgid ""
"Nope. If I can find something to like about a person, that's what I focus "
"on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6024"
msgid "Wow. You're awesome, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6036"
msgid "Is my outlook really that special?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6048"
msgid ""
"Well, it's just that when I finally meet someone who doesn't push for "
"social stereotypes, I find that refreshing. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6060"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6072"
msgid ""
"Heheh, so a barker started hitting on me as I was walking to the club. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6084"
msgid "Made me think to myself, \"Yup! Still got it!\" ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6096"
msgid "That's always a good feeling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6108"
msgid "But it's what happened afterward that really got on my nerves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6120"
msgid "What do you think he said after I turned him down?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6132"
msgid "I don't know, what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6144"
msgid ""
"He told me, \"You might seem cute from a distance, but your voice is a "
"total dealbreaker\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6156"
msgid "Haha, ouch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6168"
msgid "Heheh, I know. Hilarious, right? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6180"
msgid ""
"This isn't the first time I heard that, though. How my voice and my face "
"don't match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6192"
msgid "I'd hate to think I'm ruining my image every time I open my mouth..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6204"
msgid "Is the discrepancy really that bad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6216"
msgid "No, and I usually don't get bothered by people's snide remarks, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6228"
msgid "Good. You shouldn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6240"
msgid ""
"But the way that jerkwad said it got me real cheesed off, so I told him off "
"in front of his little barker buddies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6252"
msgid "Heh. Guess he was barking up the wrong tree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6264"
msgid ""
"Seriously. Guy should've got his facts straight. Never mess with the number "
"one hostess in Roppongi... and soon to be Kamurocho! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6276"
msgid "I personally think you have a great voice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6288"
msgid "Heheh. You really mean that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6300"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6312"
msgid "Well, it's not like I can change it on command, even if I wanted to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6324"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6336"
msgid "I was honestly surprised the first time I heard you speak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6348"
msgid "Haha, I bet you were. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6360"
msgid ""
"For real, though. When you take a look at me... would you prefer a more "
"feminine voice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6372"
msgid "Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6384"
msgid "I knew it! Argh, if only it was more pretty. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6396"
msgid ""
"But, at the same time, your voice and personality are both very strong. So "
"in that way, I think they're a perfect match."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6408"
msgid "Heheh. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Can't argue with that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6420"
msgid "Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6432"
msgid "I like your voice just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6444"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6456"
msgid "Yeah. It's pleasant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6468"
msgid ""
"Wow. Guess not everybody has the same tastes. I'm honestly a little "
"flattered. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6480"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6492"
msgid "Depends on how you sound in bed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6504"
msgid "Ahah, you're throwing out dirty jokes already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6516"
msgid "Well. How do you think I sound in bed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6528"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6540"
msgid ""
"Hehe, I'll give you a hint. I get just a tiny bit cuter. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6552"
msgid "Ooh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6564"
msgid "Isn't that good, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6576"
msgid "Huh? Isn't what good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6588"
msgid "I'm talking about the contrast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6600"
msgid "You mean between my looks and my voice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6612"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6624"
msgid "Ohhh. Yeah, I've heard that, too. Some guys even find it sexy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6636"
msgid "...It is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6648"
msgid ""
"So I ended up going to this birthday party, right? It was for one of the "
"mamas in the Champion District, and my gosh, it was a total blast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6660"
msgid "You wouldn't believe how many people fit inside that tiny little bar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6672"
msgid "Sounds like quite the party."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6684"
msgid ""
"Yeah. It was especially beautiful because so many people were there to "
"celebrate her special day. She said it was her best birthday since she "
"became a lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6696"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I was mingling with all sorts of characters there... Artists, "
"actors, even bigwig company presidents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6708"
msgid "Who would've figured she was such a celebrity?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6720"
msgid "You're talking about the Earth Angel Mama, I take it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6732"
msgid "Huh!? You know her, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6744"
msgid "Yeah. Ako, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6756"
msgid "That's the one! Wow, never would've guessed you two were acquainted! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6768"
msgid "Ahhh, that's just too crazy of a coincidence!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6780"
msgid "Isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6792"
msgid "Yeah! She's such a wonderful person, with so many stories to tell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6804"
msgid ""
"Whenever we talk, I always end up lost in conversation for hours... Deep "
"stuff, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6816"
msgid "She's definitely been around the block."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6828"
msgid "I'll bet! Mama's, like, 20 times the lady I am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6840"
msgid ""
"Heheh. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> It's like she touches the lives of "
"everyone she meets. Maybe she's a real angel after all. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6852"
msgid "You could learn a lot from her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6864"
msgid "What, you think I should start taking notes out of her book?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6876"
msgid "Not a bad idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6888"
msgid "Hey, I just might do it. After all, Mama really knows her stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6900"
msgid "That she does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6912"
msgid "You're pretty angelic yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6924"
msgid "Heheh. You really mean that? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6936"
msgid "...Yeah, I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6948"
msgid "You seriously had to stop and think about it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6960"
msgid "No, I... That wasn't my intention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6972"
msgid ""
"Heheh... I can read you like an open book, Kiryu-san. But I think that's "
"one of your good points. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6984"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6996"
msgid "Ako's the epitome of a woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7008"
msgid ""
"Isn't she!? I'm so proud to be considered her friend! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7020"
msgid "Same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7032"
msgid ""
"She teaches me all sorts of stuff, too. It's like having a\r\n"
"big sister. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7044"
msgid "That must be nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7056"
msgid ""
"I wonder, though... I was born a girl, and she was born a man, yet she's "
"more of a lady than I am. Doesn't that mean I have a lot of catching up to "
"do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7068"
msgid "...I think you should go at your own pace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7080"
msgid "So I went out drinking with some of the girls here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7092"
msgid "How'd it go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7104"
msgid "Horrible. Every time I spoke up, they thought I was angry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7116"
msgid "But then, when I didn't speak up, they said I looked bored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7128"
msgid "And that's totally not how it was! I was just trying to express myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7140"
msgid "...Ugh, I'm getting exhausted just thinking about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7152"
msgid "Sounds like you had a pretty rough night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7164"
msgid ""
"If this is how socializing's supposed to be, I might as well cut off all "
"human contact and be done with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7176"
msgid ""
"It can get pretty stressful. Not everyone has an easy time getting along "
"with others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7188"
msgid ""
"I know... All I could do at the time was try and laugh it off, even though "
"I wanted to just leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7200"
msgid "...I am so not doing that again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7212"
msgid "Wait, you think it's my voice that's the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7224"
msgid "I don't see how that's related in any sort of way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7236"
msgid "Yeah, I guess not. Maybe I'm just too used to poking fun at myself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7248"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7260"
msgid ""
"Maybe you should put in some more effort before doing something that "
"drastic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7272"
msgid ""
"After all, not everyone can understand you immediately. You might have to "
"keep correcting your friends until they get the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7284"
msgid "Whaaaat, that's lame! Why should I be the one to put in all the effort?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7296"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7308"
msgid "Wait, is it my voice that's the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7320"
msgid "...I don't see how that's related."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7332"
msgid "Yeah, I guess not. Maybe I'm just too used to poking fun at myself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7344"
msgid "Heh. Maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7356"
msgid "Well, that's just who you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7368"
msgid "No use trying to change yourself to fit people's expectations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7380"
msgid "Hahaha, yes! I'm glad there's actually someone who understands!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7392"
msgid "I try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7404"
msgid ""
"You're so easy to get along with, Kiryu-san! Okay, I've decided... You've "
"officially passed the test!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7416"
msgid "...What test?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7428"
msgid "So a friend of mine decided to give me a nickname."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7440"
msgid "Let's hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7452"
msgid "Heh, she calls me \"Super Fly\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7464"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7476"
msgid ""
"'Cause my fly's always open... and I'm super bad at remembering to zip it "
"up! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7488"
msgid "...Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7500"
msgid "...Maybe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7512"
msgid "Why don't you be more careful, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7524"
msgid "I dunno. Guess I never really made it a proper habit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7536"
msgid "How is that possible..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7548"
msgid ""
"Well, since I always forget to zip my zipper, I have my friends remind me. "
"So I never need to worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7560"
msgid ""
"Usually, it goes like this: They tell me my fly's down, I'll say something "
"like, \"Oh no, not again,\" and then we all have a good laugh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7572"
msgid ""
"Lately, all they have to do is say, \"zipper!\" and the conversation "
"continues like nothing ever happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7584"
msgid "Pretty efficient system, no? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7596"
msgid "Why don't you wear sweatpants?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7608"
msgid "Not a bad idea. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7620"
msgid "I mean, that's one less thing to worry about, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7632"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7644"
msgid "I think you need more practice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7656"
msgid "What, zipping my fly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7668"
msgid ""
"Yes. Do that a hundred times in the morning and a hundred times at night, "
"and you'll be a normal person in no time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7680"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! So you're treating it like it's exercise, huh? Might as well give "
"it a try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7692"
msgid "Hey, I didn't mean that seriously..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7704"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7716"
msgid ""
"Really? You're checking on me now? Well, I hate to disappoint you, but "
"there's no zipper. I'm wearing a dress, silly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7728"
msgid "Ah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7740"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7752"
msgid "...The zipper on your back is undone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7764"
msgid "Seriously!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7776"
msgid "Heh. Made you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7788"
msgid "Have I ever told you about my dogs, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7800"
msgid "They're, like, the most adorable little creatures in the world!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7812"
msgid "Are they now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7824"
msgid "Yup! And I've got two of 'em!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7836"
msgid "Sounds like you've got your hands full."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7848"
msgid ""
"Just a little. But wouldn't it be sad if I had only one? They'd be cooped "
"up in the house alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7860"
msgid ""
"That's why I got two: so they could be each other's friend! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7872"
msgid "Heh, all right then. What are their names?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7884"
msgid ""
"I have a fluffy little Yorkie named Soran... And a sweet little Sheltie "
"named Millay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7896"
msgid ""
"They're both super cute, and know just how to cheer me up! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7908"
msgid "Dogs have a knack for that, don't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7920"
msgid ""
"They do! ♪ Sometimes they're all that keep me going. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7932"
msgid ""
"The tough part is walking them. They're strong enough to literally drag me "
"around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7944"
msgid "Aren't they small dogs, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7956"
msgid "Hey, are you trying to call me weak? Well, you wouldn't be wrong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7968"
msgid "Good thing you don't have two German Shepherds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7980"
msgid "You must really love dogs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7992"
msgid "Sure do. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> They're probably my favorite animal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8004"
msgid ""
"The tough part is walking them. They're strong enough to literally drag me "
"around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8016"
msgid "Aren't they small dogs, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8028"
msgid "Hey, are you trying to call me weak? Well, you wouldn't be wrong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8040"
msgid "Good thing you don't have two German Shepherds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8052"
msgid "Are you walking them regularly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8064"
msgid "I think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8076"
msgid "Every single day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8088"
msgid "...Maybe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8100"
msgid "Is that a yes or a no?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8112"
msgid "Heheh. Well, I do get kinda lazy about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8124"
msgid ""
"There are days when I'm just so tired, I can't even get out of bed, let "
"alone go outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8136"
msgid "Even so, you should give your dogs a daily walk... They deserve that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8148"
msgid "Okay, so remember how my boyfriend was acting super shady!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8160"
msgid "Sort of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8172"
msgid "Well, it turns out he was cheating on me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8184"
msgid "Uh-oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8196"
msgid ""
"I had to do some serious legwork, too! Calling up all his friends, "
"intimidating confessions out of them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8208"
msgid "Only to discover the worst had come true!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8220"
msgid "What did your boyfriend have to say for himself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8232"
msgid "Not much... I had to verbally assault him until he finally came clean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8244"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8256"
msgid ""
"Urrrgh! It's like, why would he do me like that? I gave him my heart, I "
"gave him my trust, I even gave him a spot in my company, and this is how he "
"treats me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8268"
msgid ""
"Anyway... He eventually started apologizing. Told me he couldn't live "
"without me and all that... And sure enough, I ended up forgiving him like "
"the fool I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8280"
msgid "I swear, sometimes I think the world is better off without men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8292"
msgid "Did you really dig through all his friends?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8304"
msgid "Every last one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8316"
msgid "And all of them said the same thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8328"
msgid "Exactly the same thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8340"
msgid ""
"I did my homework, Kiryu-san! He's a no-good, lying, pathetic excuse for a "
"man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8352"
msgid "I'm impressed you went that far, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8364"
msgid ""
"Hey. When I put my mind to it, I get shit done. Pardon the language, but "
"that's just how I'm feeling right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8376"
msgid "You're fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8388"
msgid "A little double-dipping never hurt anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8400"
msgid "<Italic>Wrong</Italic>!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8412"
msgid ""
"You cheat on me, you die! Or at least I'll make you regret it so much, "
"you'll wish you were dead. And then I'll dump you on the spot... so at "
"least you're dead to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8424"
msgid "You should tell that to your boyfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8436"
msgid "Ugh, let's just drop the subject already!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8448"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8460"
msgid "How could he betray a wonderful woman like you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8472"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8484"
msgid "What he did was unforgivable. And I'll make him pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8496"
msgid ""
"Hehe, you don't have to act tough for my sake. ♪ But still, I'm glad you're "
"on my side. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8508"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8520"
msgid "So, I found out my friend's company went under."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8532"
msgid "Just like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8544"
msgid "Yeah. Without her telling me a thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8556"
msgid ""
"I had been trying to get in contact with her, but she never returned any of "
"my calls..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8568"
msgid "Guess now I know why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8580"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8592"
msgid ""
"I know people think presidents and others at the top don't do an ounce of "
"work, but it's actually quite the opposite. It's one of the hardest "
"positions to have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8604"
msgid "...Maybe I'm extra sensitive about this stuff because of what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8616"
msgid ""
"Last time we talked on the phone, she said she was doing good, too... Both "
"her and her company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8628"
msgid ""
"But I guess you never know till it happens. Sometimes the world's on your "
"side, and sometimes it pulls the rug right out from under you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8640"
msgid "You really can't reach her at all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8652"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8664"
msgid "I hope she's okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8676"
msgid "I hope so too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8688"
msgid "Can't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8700"
msgid "Nope, especially not in the business world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8712"
msgid ""
"My company's really small, so even the tiniest mistake can completely screw "
"us over. It's kinda scary that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8724"
msgid "That's why I'm always super careful... about everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8736"
msgid "That's fine and all... but remember, nobody's perfect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8748"
msgid ""
"Hey, I'm not too worried! If my company does come crashing down, I'll just "
"file for bankruptcy... and then we'll file for marriage! I'll be your "
"trophy wife. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8760"
msgid "Hey, since when did I agree to that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8772"
msgid "Why, is that a no? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8784"
msgid "At least let me think about it first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8796"
msgid "How's your company?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8808"
msgid "Are you asking... am I in danger of going under anytime soon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8820"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8832"
msgid "Mm, I think we're okay for now? At least, I hope so. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8844"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8856"
msgid "Hey, do you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8868"
msgid "What? Do I what, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8880"
msgid "Do you know how to cook?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8892"
msgid "Oh. Yeah, I do. Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8904"
msgid "I was wondering what kind of food you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8916"
msgid ""
"Well, just yesterday, I made curry, mapo eggplant, and osuimono with "
"matsutake mushrooms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8928"
msgid "Sounds like a full-course meal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8940"
msgid "Heheh, it was. You gotta make what you like, you know? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8952"
msgid "It's great that you enjoy cooking like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8964"
msgid ""
"It's even better when you have someone to cook for... Reminds me of the guy "
"I dated in high school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8976"
msgid ""
"He was the type of person who expected a piping-hot meal the minute he got "
"home... Now that I think about it, he was actually kind of a prick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8988"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9000"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'd go grocery shopping every day after school just so I'd get to "
"cook for him. And I didn't even mind at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9012"
msgid "Sounds like you'd make a great wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9024"
msgid "You really think so!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9036"
msgid "Yeah, I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9048"
msgid ""
"Then I'm gonna be the best wife you ever saw! And don't let my starlet "
"looks fool you⑬I'm actually a pretty good caretaker!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9060"
msgid "I can see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9072"
msgid "You really go all-out on everything, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9084"
msgid "Hehe, yup! I'm sure I don't seem like it at first glance, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9096"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I never would've guessed. That is, until I got to know you a little "
"better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9108"
msgid ""
"See, that's how I make 'em fall for me. On the outside, I look like I "
"wouldn't even give you the time of day, but if I like you, I'll treat you "
"like a king. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9120"
msgid "Heh. I can see that as a good thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9132"
msgid "Then... Would you say you'd be attracted to a woman like me? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9144"
msgid "If we're talking about you specifically... then yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9156"
msgid "Can I come over to eat sometime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9168"
msgid "Heh, you really wanna try my cooking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9180"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9192"
msgid "Okay then, sure. As long as you wear a dog costume. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9204"
msgid "Why in the world would I do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9216"
msgid ""
"Well, I don't want my boyfriend finding out you're over... So I'll pretend "
"you're my third dog! Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9228"
msgid "...Yeah, that's not gonna happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9240"
msgid "I'm getting pretty sick of this, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9252"
msgid "Sick of what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9264"
msgid "Working two jobs... It's eating away at me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9276"
msgid "Don't you have any downtime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9288"
msgid "No, not really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9300"
msgid ""
"Even though I'm the president of a company, I still can't control my own "
"life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9312"
msgid ""
"Like, I don't even have time to feel feelings, let alone cope with my "
"stress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9324"
msgid ""
"Maybe you should take a few nights off? Getting proper sleep will at least "
"help you get your energy levels back where they need to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9336"
msgid ""
"I'd love to, but right now I gotta focus on the club. The owner's really "
"counting on me here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9348"
msgid "As tough as it is to keep going, I still want to give it my all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9360"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9372"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't be who I am today if it weren't for the club... Not to mention "
"the city of Kamurocho itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9384"
msgid ""
"The people I work with at my company, everyone from this job... My whole "
"social network is counting on me to do my best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9396"
msgid "And if I stopped doing that, I feel like I'd be letting everyone down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9408"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9420"
msgid ""
"So, as long as I can still breathe, and get up every morning... I'm gonna "
"keep on keeping on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9432"
msgid "You're missing something crucial."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9444"
msgid "Huh!? I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9456"
msgid ""
"By stretching yourself thin, you'll only end up doing things halfheartedly. "
"Wouldn't it be better to give each thing you're focused on 100％ of your "
"attention?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9468"
msgid "I... see your point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9480"
msgid "Yeah. You just might be right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9492"
msgid ""
"Maybe I was only doing things 50/50. I need to crank up my effort to 200％ "
"so each job can get an even 100!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9504"
msgid ""
"No, what I'm saying is, you've been doing more than enough. Try cutting "
"your workload down instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9516"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9528"
msgid "I'll at least think about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9540"
msgid "You should."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9552"
msgid "I understand where you're coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9564"
msgid "Yeah? I knew you would get me. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9576"
msgid ""
"Besides, I want to do things in a way that satisfies me. That naturally "
"requires extra effort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9588"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9600"
msgid "...Or maybe I just suck at life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9612"
msgid ""
"Maybe I take extra time and energy to process everything and that's why it "
"feels like I'm going so hard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9624"
msgid "I think you're fine the way you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9636"
msgid "Haha... I'll take your word for it, then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9648"
msgid "Does that mean you'll finally cut yourself some slack?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9660"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9672"
msgid "I'll think about the best way to do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9684"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9696"
msgid ""
"Won't that just make things worse? It sounds like you're scrambling around, "
"trying to get everything done at once. Keep that up, and nothing will turn "
"out the way you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9708"
msgid "...Guess that is kinda what's happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9720"
msgid "No wonder I'm so drained all the time... It's because I suck at life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9732"
msgid "I never said that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9744"
msgid ""
"Then why? Why can I not accomplish the things I want and still have a life "
"left to live?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9756"
msgid "Look, just go a little easier on yourself. Don't take everything so hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9768"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9780"
msgid "But at the same time, don't do things halfheartedly. Balance is the key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9792"
msgid "...Maybe I'm just a lost cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9804"
msgid "That's rather extreme..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9816"
msgid ""
"All right, I've decided! In a year from now, I'm gonna be a happily married "
"woman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9828"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9840"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I was looking up some bridal stuff for my company today, and I never "
"realized how fun a wedding could be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9852"
msgid ""
"I was going through all sorts of pictures⑬wedding dresses, venues, "
"catering, honeymoon packages⑬the whole shebang!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9864"
msgid "Seeing all that made me want to get married on the spot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9876"
msgid "Would you marry your current boyfriend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9888"
msgid "Hmm... Now there's a question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9900"
msgid "...I doubt he'd actually go through with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9912"
msgid "And why does it have to be within a year?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9924"
msgid "It takes about a year to properly prepare, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9936"
msgid ""
"So I figure that'd give me an ample amount of time to set things up exactly "
"how I want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9948"
msgid "You should think it through more seriously."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9960"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9972"
msgid "I mean, you don't even know who your partner will be, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9984"
msgid "Well, no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9996"
msgid "Is that all you have to say...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10008"
msgid ""
"Then why don't you marry me, and we'll be done with it? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10020"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10032"
msgid "Heheh, did you just turn red? You totally did. I saw it. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10044"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10056"
msgid "You'll be saying that three months from now, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10068"
msgid "...I might be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10080"
msgid "But that'd be totally uncool, huh? Saying something but not acting on it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10092"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10104"
msgid ""
"Okay then, I'll get married within the next ten years. That should give me "
"plenty of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10116"
msgid "I don't think the time frame is the issue here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10128"
msgid "You should figure out your partner before then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10140"
msgid "Yeah, probably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10152"
msgid "I know! How about you, Kiryu-san? Wanna join together in holy matrimony?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10164"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10176"
msgid "I'm saying we should get married! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10188"
msgid "...Maybe when you ask me seriously, I'll give you a serious answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10200"
msgid "You know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10212"
msgid "I'm starting to think I suck at choosing guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10224"
msgid "What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10236"
msgid ""
"Well. Every boyfriend I've ever had has pretty much treated me like dirt. "
"Heck, they treated everyone around them that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10248"
msgid "Those kinds are the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10260"
msgid "And they all seemed so sweet in the beginning..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10272"
msgid "Be careful who you trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10284"
msgid "I probably should, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10296"
msgid "It's common sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10308"
msgid "Yeah... I know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10320"
msgid "But I will say one thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10332"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10344"
msgid "When you do find someone worth trusting, stand by them till the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10356"
msgid "Ooh... That was cool. I want to write that down and post it on my fridge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10368"
msgid ""
"You're so different, Kiryu-san... I love that about you. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10380"
msgid "Seriously! You have such a unique perspective on life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10392"
msgid "...Yeah, I've been through some stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10404"
msgid ""
"That's their strategy to lure you in. They pretend to be nice at first, but "
"once they've gained your trust, they're quick to drop the act."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10416"
msgid "Right. You know the saying, \"You don't feed the fish you already caught\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10428"
msgid "Why's it gotta be like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10440"
msgid "Because men live for the hunt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10452"
msgid "...What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10464"
msgid ""
"I think, from a man's perspective, everything is either \"hunt or be "
"hunted.\" It's an instinct that can't be ignored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10476"
msgid ""
"I see... And men who can't hunt don't survive. Or at least they don't "
"reproduce."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10488"
msgid "Something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10500"
msgid "Wait, so that means guys view women as their prey? That's terrible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10512"
msgid "...Yeah, it kind of is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10524"
msgid ""
"Maybe you can start over with a clean slate. Leave all those bad "
"experiences behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10536"
msgid "Haha, that's how I'm trying to think. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10548"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10560"
msgid "If anything, this taught me to be more careful as a person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10572"
msgid "It never hurts to exercise a little caution in your life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10584"
msgid ""
"So I went to Fukuoka for work the other day, and my friend who lives there "
"gave me a huge box of mentaiko! Pretty sweet, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10596"
msgid "That's a nice gesture. How often do you travel for work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10608"
msgid "Oh, all the time, really. Mostly for events and stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10620"
msgid "What kind of events are they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10632"
msgid ""
"Oh, so, I'll wear some of the dresses I made in front of potential buyers. "
"That way they can see how it looks in person before they commit to "
"manufacturing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10644"
msgid ""
"Of course, they'll want a long, drawn-out photoshoot, too. By the end of it "
"all, I'm pretty much ready to collapse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10656"
msgid ""
"Guess that's just the life of a model who makes her own clothes. Hehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10668"
msgid "Even this dress is something I came up with! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10680"
msgid "That's impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10692"
msgid "Yay, a compliment. ♪ Means a lot from you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10704"
msgid "I'm just glad you're able to keep it all together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10716"
msgid ""
"Heh. Thanks to you, I haven't gone insane just yet! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10728"
msgid "And how's your body feeling? Are you still tired all the time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10740"
msgid ""
"Mm, I could use a good power nap every now and then... about a hundred in a "
"row. But hey, I'm holding up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10752"
msgid ""
"It's amazing you can do all that, on top of keeping a night job. You're "
"definitely one of a kind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10764"
msgid "I'd like to go to some of these events too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10776"
msgid "Yeah? Then I'll call you up the moment I book the next one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10788"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10800"
msgid ""
"Heheh. ♪ It really fires me up to see a big turnout, so I'd love it if you "
"were a part of that! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10812"
msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10824"
msgid "Do actually show up though, okay? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10836"
msgid "I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10848"
msgid "I know how you can step up your game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10860"
msgid "Really. And would you kindly elaborate on how?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10872"
msgid ""
"I think you could, you know, show a little more skin. You might get a "
"bigger reaction that way... in more ways than one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10884"
msgid ""
"Uh...huh. You are aware that modeling is more than just being promiscuous, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10896"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10908"
msgid ""
"Wow. You really have some nerve, saying that right to my face. And you're "
"not even gonna apologize?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10920"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10932"
msgid "Kiryu-san, can I ask you something? Be warned, it's kinda complicated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10944"
msgid "Ask away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10956"
msgid ""
"Okay, so let's say you're dating this girl. You two have been going out for "
"a while; you like her, she likes you, there's a lot of trust there. But "
"then you find out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10968"
msgid ""
"She's been working as a hostess, or some other night job, this whole time, "
"and never told you a thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10980"
msgid "Would you hold it against her? Or would you be able to let it go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10992"
msgid ""
"I don't think I could let that slide. Without honesty, your relationship is "
"doomed to fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11004"
msgid "Hmm. That's a valid point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11016"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11028"
msgid ""
"Well, one of our girls was in the same situation. And she couldn't decide "
"whether she should tell her boyfriend or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11040"
msgid "I see... That's quite a dilemma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11052"
msgid "Me personally, I'd just straight out tell him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11064"
msgid "But not everybody thinks like me, so that's why I'm asking around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11076"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11088"
msgid ""
"Now here's a better question for you. If you and me were dating, would your "
"answer still be the same?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11100"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11112"
msgid "Call me stubborn, but I still couldn't forgive you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11124"
msgid "Oh, wow. You really stick to your guns, don't you? Heheh. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11136"
msgid "I guess I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11148"
msgid "If it's you, that's a different story. I'd probably let it slide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11160"
msgid "Whaaat? Are you really saying that, or are you just trying to please me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11172"
msgid "What's wrong with what I said?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11184"
msgid ""
"You changed your opinion 'cause you thought it would make me happy. Nobody "
"likes a backtracker, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11196"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11208"
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure I'd let it go. No one has the right to judge how another "
"person makes their money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11220"
msgid "Ohhh, I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11232"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11244"
msgid ""
"Well, one of our girls was in this situation, and couldn't decide whether "
"she should tell her boyfriend or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11256"
msgid "I see... That's quite a dilemma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11268"
msgid "Me personally, I'd just straight out tell him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11280"
msgid "But not everybody thinks like me, so that's why I'm asking around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11292"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11304"
msgid "Wait a minute, so if you and I were dating, you'd forgive me too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11316"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11328"
msgid "Of course I would."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11340"
msgid "I knew it. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Guess you like me just that much. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11352"
msgid ""
"It's not that I'd let you off the hook, no questions asked. But I would "
"have faith in you as my partner, and that's something that can't be broken "
"so easily."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11364"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You're great, Kiryu-san! Such an "
"understanding guy! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11376"
msgid "Thanks. I try to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11388"
msgid "It might not be that easy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11400"
msgid "Huh!? Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11412"
msgid "Well, because I'd be worried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11424"
msgid "Worried...? About me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11436"
msgid ""
"Yeah. If I suddenly found out you were working in an industry that has less "
"than a stellar reputation, then of course I'd be concerned. Nobody leaves a "
"good woman alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11448"
msgid ""
"Aww... That's sweet... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Enough to make a woman "
"cry. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11460"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11472"
msgid "That's a good question..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11484"
msgid "What, so you don't know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11496"
msgid "Well, my answer depends on who it is I'm dating in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11508"
msgid "Ah! Yeah. You're right. Guess you need to know who you're dealing with, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11520"
msgid ""
"Yep. To me, this situation is more about the person rather than the "
"incident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11532"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11544"
msgid ""
"Well, one of our girls was actually going through this, and she couldn't "
"decide whether she should tell her boyfriend or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11556"
msgid "I see... That's quite a dilemma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11568"
msgid "Me personally, I'd straight out tell him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11580"
msgid "But not everybody thinks like me, so that's why I'm asking around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11592"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11604"
msgid ""
"You know, when I first came to Tokyo, I never imagined things would turn "
"out this way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11616"
msgid "What I do, the way I am, hardly resembles the old, Kyoto version of me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11628"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11640"
msgid "It's been such a blur these past five years..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11652"
msgid ""
"There's just so much going on here... You either adapt quick, or get "
"swallowed up in the mix."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11664"
msgid "And, as exciting as that sounds, it's actually pretty scary! Haha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11676"
msgid "I can understand where you're coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11688"
msgid ""
"But hey, you know what? Despite all the emotional ups and downs, I think my "
"little adventure's turned out pretty well. At least so far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11700"
msgid "Sounds like you've grown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11712"
msgid "I sure hope so. I just don't wanna worry myself sick again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11724"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11736"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11748"
msgid ""
"Oh! But I have been good about zipping up my zipper! That's gotta count for "
"something, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11760"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11772"
msgid ""
"You can surpass yourself even further. Be the strong, successful woman "
"you're truly meant to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11784"
msgid "Heheh. That's cool of you to say, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11796"
msgid "I really mean it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11808"
msgid ""
"Heh. Only you can get away with saying that kinda stuff, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11820"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11832"
msgid "Oh yeah. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11844"
msgid "Heh. Then I'm flattered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11856"
msgid "Sounds like you've had it pretty easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11868"
msgid ""
"Wait, so just 'cause things have turned out well for me, you think I've "
"been taking it easy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11880"
msgid "...You probably don't think I have a care in the world, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11892"
msgid "No, that's not what I meant..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11904"
msgid "Ugh. Why are old people so quick to judge..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11916"
msgid "You... didn't have to call me old..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11928"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, so I emailed my friend in Kyoto, and we finally decided to hang "
"out. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11940"
msgid "Oh, good for you guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11952"
msgid ""
"And get this, Kiryu-san. She said, \"Make sure you bring a guy who's "
"loaded!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11964"
msgid "Then I told her, \"Girl, that was way back when!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11976"
msgid "So, what, she wants you to introduce her to a rich guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11988"
msgid "Basically!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12000"
msgid ""
"You see, back when we were in high school, being super preppy was the "
"ultimate thing you could be. So the four of us, myself included, did "
"everything we could to live that life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12012"
msgid "Every single week, we'd go on a different group date..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12024"
msgid ""
"Oh, and only the cutest, richest guys were allowed. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Sorry to all you squares! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12036"
msgid ""
"...That was actually how we thought back then, but hey, we got ourselves "
"some pretty nice play money. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12048"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12060"
msgid "That's a little sad for the guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12072"
msgid ""
"Hey, they were happy about it. It's not like we were using them or "
"anything⑬it was more like a mutual exchange. They showered us with money, "
"we gave them attention. Simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12084"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12096"
msgid ""
"Though the places they hauled us around to were far beyond the scope of "
"your average salaryman. I'm talking five-star French restaurants here, with "
"a waiting list a mile long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12108"
msgid "Sounds like you were one pretentious high schooler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12120"
msgid "Yeah, I was pretty full of it back then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12132"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12144"
msgid ""
"It's weird, 'cause the guys in my class would speak to me all formal. Maybe "
"they wanted to impress me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12156"
msgid "...Or they could've been distancing themselves from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12168"
msgid ""
"...Yeah, that's probably what it was. Now that I think about it, I must've "
"been pretty annoying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12180"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12192"
msgid "You sure you're still not like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12204"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12216"
msgid "Well... Considering I'm in this line of work, then yeah, maybe I kinda am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12228"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12240"
msgid ""
"But you could say I've been developing important life skills this entire "
"time! ♪ The only difference now is, the guys come to me! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12252"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12264"
msgid "So I ended up going to the Champion District the other day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12276"
msgid "You went to Ako's place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12288"
msgid "Yep, and she was right there waiting for me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12300"
msgid "That's good to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12312"
msgid "But man... I totally messed things up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12324"
msgid "What did you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12336"
msgid ""
"I drank too much and passed out at the counter. And that's just the tip of "
"the iceberg!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12348"
msgid ""
"So yeah. Everyone got super worried, and one of Mama's friends tried to "
"move me to the sofa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12360"
msgid "But apparently I punched out whoever was trying to carry me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12372"
msgid ""
"Then I kicked someone else who tried to stop the punching! Heheh, it's "
"like, when did I get such a wild side? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12384"
msgid "More like a violent streak..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12396"
msgid "Then, when I ran into one of Mama's friends near the station..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12408"
msgid ""
"She told me I scared the living daylights out of her⑬not just as a person, "
"but as a woman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12420"
msgid ""
"\"You're supposed to be a lady, so start acting like one!\" Something along "
"those lines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12432"
msgid ""
"It's bad enough I hear that from my friends, but from an okama? Guess my "
"rep at Earth Angel went spiraling down the drain..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12444"
msgid "Maybe you have a sinister alter ego that comes out only when you're drunk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12456"
msgid "Uhhh... I guess?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12468"
msgid ""
"Ehehe. I totally don't know what that means. Oh, but I know what an altar "
"is! You pray in front of it, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12480"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12492"
msgid "You're not drunk right now, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12504"
msgid "Eheh... Heh... Heheheheh! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12516"
msgid ""
"Come onnnn, Kiryu-saaaan! We're at the cluuub! It's fine to go a little "
"overboard! Know what I meeeean!? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12528"
msgid "...Yeah, you're definitely wasted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12540"
msgid "That's, like, super awful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12552"
msgid "Ahahaha, wow! ♪ I did not expect that from you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12564"
msgid "Just trying to lighten the mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12576"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah? Well, how's this for lightening the mood? "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12588"
msgid "...Consider the mood lightened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12600"
msgid "You remember my dog Soran? The Yorkie?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12612"
msgid "Come to think of it, yeah. I do remember you said you had a dog like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12624"
msgid "So, he just got out of the clinic not too long ago..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12636"
msgid "Was he sick or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12648"
msgid "Well... His eye was hurt pretty bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12660"
msgid "Apparently it happened when he stayed overnight at the pet hotel..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12672"
msgid ""
"I feel terrible because I wasn't actually there when it happened. He "
"must've been so scared..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12684"
msgid ""
"What's worse is that it's all my fault. There was nothing I could do for "
"him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12696"
msgid ""
"And when the vet said he had to stay at the clinic, I totally broke down "
"and cried. Ugh, I'm still about to cry at any moment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12708"
msgid "Sorry you had to go through that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12720"
msgid ""
"But, when he finally got out, it reminded me of just how important it is to "
"spend time with the ones you love. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12732"
msgid ""
"So lately, when I don't have anything else going on, I go straight back "
"home to my little puppy-babies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12744"
msgid "Where's this pet hotel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12756"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Don't tell me you plan on going there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12768"
msgid ""
"I am. And I'm gonna get the truth about what happened to your dog... no "
"matter what it takes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12780"
msgid "That's not gonna help. All you'll end up doing is causing a huge mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12792"
msgid "Just let me do my thing, and everything will work out fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12804"
msgid "Kiryu-san! You're taking the totally wrong approach here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12816"
msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12828"
msgid "That must have been tough for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12840"
msgid ""
"It was. I mean, if I hadn't put him in the hotel, he never would've got "
"hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12852"
msgid "At least your attitude shows you care about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12864"
msgid "...Clearly I don't care about him enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12876"
msgid ""
"I always feel sorry that he's stuck with an owner like me. That's why I "
"apologize to him every time I leave him by himself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12888"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12900"
msgid "He is family, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12912"
msgid "That's what I think, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12924"
msgid "Heh. Dogs are like our slobbery little siblings, aren't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12936"
msgid ""
"Sure. Oh, and you know how there's people out there who abandon their pets "
"at the shelter or even on the street?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12948"
msgid ""
"I can't believe those people are even allowed to have pets in the first "
"place. You don't just throw away your family, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12960"
msgid "...No one should get away with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12972"
msgid "You seem like the kind of guy who'd do anything for his family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12984"
msgid "I make it my goal to be that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12996"
msgid "I knew you'd say something like that, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13008"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13020"
msgid ""
"I noticed that the girls here have finally started easing into their jobs, "
"and as a result, the club has a much better atmosphere. Wouldn't you say "
"so, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13032"
msgid "Yeah, I can see that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13044"
msgid ""
"Good. It's nice to work at a place where people can be themselves. At that "
"point, it's almost like being paid to have fun. Plus, it's better for "
"sales, too. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13056"
msgid "Sounds like all your hard work is paying off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13068"
msgid "No way, I haven't really done anything! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13080"
msgid ""
"Well, I think you've done quite a bit. I can see it in your attitude every "
"time we talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13092"
msgid "...That's sweet of you, Kiryu-san. Thanks. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13104"
msgid ""
"Maybe this is where I throw in the towel, then? After all, I do have my "
"company to focus on, and it needs all the attention it can get right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13116"
msgid "Does that mean you're quitting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13128"
msgid "Hmm. Maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13140"
msgid "What do you think I should do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13152"
msgid "I think it's fine if you left. At this point, you've done all you can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13164"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13176"
msgid "So you don't care either way? You'd be fine with not seeing me anymore?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13188"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13200"
msgid "That's not quite what I meant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13212"
msgid ""
"Sorry. It's just that, for a moment, you sounded exactly like that piece of "
"trash I just can't seem to get rid of, and it really grated on my nerves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13224"
msgid "...Piece of trash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13236"
msgid "I'm talking about my boyfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13248"
msgid "Oh yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13260"
msgid "Dumbass is still swearing up and down he'll never cheat again. Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13272"
msgid "I suppose that's a good thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13284"
msgid "You'll make the right decision either way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13296"
msgid "Huh!? How can you be so sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13308"
msgid ""
"It's simple. If quitting is the answer you came up with, then I agree. If "
"not, then I'll support you at the club. That's all there is to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13320"
msgid ""
"Ohhhh, so that's what you meant. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Heheh, you're "
"such a guy, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13332"
msgid "You should teach that piece of trash how to be a man, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13344"
msgid "...Piece of trash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13356"
msgid "Yeah, my boyfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13368"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13380"
msgid "Dumbass is still swearing up and down he'll never cheat again. Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13392"
msgid "I suppose that's a good thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13404"
msgid "All I know is that it's gonna be lonely without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13416"
msgid "Aww! ♪ You really mean that, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13428"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13440"
msgid "Hehe, then I'm a happy hostess. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13452"
msgid ""
"...It's totally different from when that stupid piece of trash complains "
"about being lonely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13464"
msgid "...Piece of trash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13476"
msgid "Yeah. My boyfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13488"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13500"
msgid "Dumbass is still swearing up and down he'll never cheat again. Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13512"
msgid "I suppose that's a good thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13524"
msgid "Kiryu-san, can I tell you something personal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13536"
msgid "I'm all ears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13548"
msgid ""
"Normally, I'm a pretty confident person. Whenever someone doubts me, or "
"even puts me down, I can usually shrug it off, no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13560"
msgid ""
"But when people I trust betray me, or even find something to dislike about "
"me, it's like I lose my entire sense of self-worth. I know, it's stupid, "
"but still."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13572"
msgid ""
"It's just that so much has happened to me in the past, and, with what's "
"been going on in my life now... I can't get it out of my head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13584"
msgid "Sounds like you've been through a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13596"
msgid "...Maybe this is all because there's somebody I don't wanna lose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13608"
msgid "Could that somebody be me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13620"
msgid "Heheh. Could be. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13632"
msgid "Heh. I see I'm gonna have to work for that answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13644"
msgid ""
"Well, I can tell you one thing. You seem like a really honest guy. I'd be "
"surprised if you've ever told a lie in your life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13656"
msgid "I'm glad you think that about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13668"
msgid ""
"I guess that means I trust you, so don't let me down, okay? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13680"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13692"
msgid "I can definitely relate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13704"
msgid "Have you... been betrayed before, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13716"
msgid "...You could say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13728"
msgid "Gosh... Who would push a nice guy like you out of their life?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13740"
msgid ""
"Then again, I'm sure there's a lot more to you than you initially let on. "
"Bet I haven't even scratched the surface of all those dark, lonely secrets "
"buried within..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13752"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13764"
msgid "But maybe that's just part of your charm. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13776"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13788"
msgid "Make sure you don't lose yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13800"
msgid "Huh? What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13812"
msgid ""
"I'm saying you should get a grasp on who you are first. After all, if you "
"can't rely on yourself, then how are you supposed to rely on others?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13824"
msgid "...Yeah, so I'm not really getting what that has to do with anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13836"
msgid ""
"Besides, you're asking me to not lose myself? Uhh... I'm right here, "
"Kiryu-san. I know where I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13848"
msgid "...Never mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13860"
msgid "Kiryu-san, I'm thinking of quitting the club after tonight. I mean it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13872"
msgid "So the time has finally come, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13884"
msgid "Honestly, it's been time. I think it just took me a while to realize it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13896"
msgid ""
"After all, this club was pretty much my starting point, both as a hostess "
"and as a businesswoman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13908"
msgid ""
"That's why I've been here so long... I wanted to stay here and support the "
"place that's supported me for as long as I possibly could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13920"
msgid ""
"Yet, at the same time, I feel like I've been losing my grasp on how to run "
"a business, and my company's paying the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13932"
msgid ""
"As much as I wanna do both, it's gotten to the point where I can't do two "
"things at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13944"
msgid "It's like what you told me before..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13956"
msgid "To not do things halfheartedly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13968"
msgid "Yeah... I did say something like that, didn't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13980"
msgid "Mhm. You've really taught me a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13992"
msgid "And I wanna put everything I have into what I do from now on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14004"
msgid "So, you're gonna be my last customer, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14016"
msgid "Your last customer, huh... Feels strange hearing that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14028"
msgid "...Yeah, it sure feels strange saying it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14040"
msgid "It'll be lonely in here without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14052"
msgid ""
"Then let's enjoy a drink together... one last time! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14064"
msgid "Heh... Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14076"
msgid "It's been a pleasure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14088"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Thanks for everything! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14100"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14112"
msgid ""
"You know, I'm glad that out of all people who could give me a proper "
"send-off, it ended up being you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14124"
msgid "So let's party the night away... one last time! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14136"
msgid "Heh... Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14148"
msgid "Pop some champagne?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14160"
msgid "Heheh, of course. ♪ It is my retirement party, after all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14172"
msgid "To good times!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14232"
msgid "Thanks, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14244"
msgid ""
"Out of all the people who could've come to see me off, I'm glad it ended up "
"being you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14256"
msgid "So let's party the night away... one last time! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14268"
msgid "Heh... Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14280"
msgid ""
"I'm sure I talked about this before, but do you remember how I said I might "
"not have a good eye for guys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14292"
msgid "You did mention something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14304"
msgid "Well, what do you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14316"
msgid "...About what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14328"
msgid ""
"I'm asking you if you agree with me or not? 'Cause lately, it feels like "
"all I run into are scumbags."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14340"
msgid "Hmm. Then what's your criteria for a good guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14352"
msgid ""
"Well, a guy's gotta have personality. It's what's inside that counts, "
"right? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14364"
msgid ""
"For example. Let's say I turn a guy down, but he keeps on chasing after "
"me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14376"
msgid ""
"Naturally, I'd think, \"Wow, he must be really committed!\" And I'll end up "
"giving him a chance. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14388"
msgid "I think I see what the issue is here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14400"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14412"
msgid "Is there something wrong with my approach?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14424"
msgid "Not exactly. I just think you need to learn how to tell some guys no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14436"
msgid ""
"No way! You're kidding, right? ...Okay, maybe you aren't kidding, but dang. "
"Anything I could do to fix it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14448"
msgid "Yeah... Just say no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14460"
msgid "What's that got to do with personality?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14472"
msgid ""
"Huh? It has everything to do with personality. Isn't it good when a guy's "
"persistent?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14484"
msgid ""
"Not when it's for the wrong reasons... I'm starting to think you have a "
"weakness for men who are overly aggressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14496"
msgid "What!? You really think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14508"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14520"
msgid ""
"Okay, well... Maybe I need to update my personality criteria, but at least "
"I'm not too judgmental about a guy's looks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14532"
msgid "I don't think that quite makes up for it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14544"
msgid ""
"All they're doing is being aggressive with you, Reimi. Don't give men like "
"that your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14556"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14568"
msgid "Oh no! Kiryu-san... you're absolutely right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14580"
msgid "Ugh, I bet all they wanted to do was get in my pants, too! Ewwww!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14592"
msgid "I'm glad you finally noticed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14604"
msgid "Yeah, thanks for giving a girl a heads-up! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14616"
msgid "Any time I can, I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14628"
msgid "All right, Kiryu-san. Forget what I'm about to tell you, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14640"
msgid "Why? What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14652"
msgid "I wanted to say... that... I wish I'd met you way earlier in life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14664"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14676"
msgid "I mean, I know I'm in a relationship and all. At least right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14688"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14700"
msgid ""
"Lately, whenever we get together, all these doubts start racing through my "
"head..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14712"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14724"
msgid ""
"I mean, the guy who's in my life right now also works at my company, so "
"it's already tangled enough as it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14736"
msgid "And in spite of all that's happened between us, I do still trust him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14748"
msgid "But sometimes... Oh, I just don't know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14760"
msgid "You don't have to say any more. I understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14772"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14784"
msgid "Now, I am happy you feel that way about me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14796"
msgid ""
"But isn't it more important to take care of who you're with? After all, you "
"two are in a relationship, and us... well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14808"
msgid ""
"...What is wrong with me? I'm so sorry, Kiryu-san... I never should've "
"brought this up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14820"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14832"
msgid ""
"Sometimes it's okay to cave into those burning desires. Besides, a little "
"fling never hurt anybody, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14844"
msgid "...Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14856"
msgid "I was being serious, Kiryu-san! And you had to go and ruin it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14868"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14880"
msgid "You're terrible sometimes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14892"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14904"
msgid "I have something to tell you too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14916"
msgid "Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14928"
msgid "Forget I said this, if that's more convenient for you, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14940"
msgid "But what!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14952"
msgid "I have the same feelings for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14964"
msgid "You do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14976"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14988"
msgid "Kiryu-san... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You made me so happy just now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15000"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, I might just have to forget it... for the sake of keeping "
"everything together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15012"
msgid "I figured as much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15024"
msgid "Ahhh, but that almost breaks my heart..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15036"
msgid "Guess what, Kiryu-san! My sister just put out a book!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15048"
msgid ""
"...Well, she's not my actual sister, but we're pretty much\r\n"
" that close! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15060"
msgid ""
"She's really amazing, too! So much life and love packed into one person... "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15072"
msgid "It's nice to have someone like that around. Anyway, what's the book about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15084"
msgid "Oh, it's something that'll change your whole outlook on life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15096"
msgid ""
"It's got two main points. The first is, if you can't dream it, you can't be "
"it. Basically, everything will be impossible for you if you have a negative "
"outlook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15108"
msgid ""
"And the second, probably most important one, is that whatever you think can "
"be brought into reality. All with the power of your mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15120"
msgid "I suppose that has some merit to it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15132"
msgid ""
"The book goes on to say that \"thoughts are things.\" Like, whatever goes "
"on inside your head is as real as what's out here. And whenever something "
"good or bad happens..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15144"
msgid "It's because, at some level, you wanted it to happen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15156"
msgid "Don't you think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15168"
msgid "Makes sense to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15180"
msgid "Right? It's, like, so logical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15192"
msgid ""
"So maybe if I keep thinking about how I feel about someone, that'll become "
"reality too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15204"
msgid "That very well could be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15240"
msgid "Ooh, I hope it reaches him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15252"
msgid "And who are you trying to reach with this secret technique of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15264"
msgid ""
"It wouldn't be much of a secret if I told you, now would it? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15276"
msgid "Why? Did something bad happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15288"
msgid "Huh? No. What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15300"
msgid ""
"Well, you're laying on the philosophy pretty thick right now. Isn't that "
"kind of book reserved for when you're climbing out of a deep, dark pit of "
"depression... or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15312"
msgid "...What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15324"
msgid "I just thought it was a little complex, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15336"
msgid ""
"It's not complex at all! Don't you find it at least a little bit "
"inspirational? As in, like, a hopeful message to help you through everyday "
"life?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15348"
msgid "Well, I'm trying to wrap my head around it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15360"
msgid "...Did something bad happen to you, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15372"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15384"
msgid "I'll think of something right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15396"
msgid ""
"Hehe, okay then. Share a little of that psychic energy with me. What are "
"you imagining?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15408"
msgid "Wouldn't you like to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15420"
msgid "Of course I'd like to know! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15432"
msgid ""
"Heh. I'm actually thinking about peeling away your clothes... one layer at "
"a time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15444"
msgid "Uh. Kiryu-san. You're being a total creeper right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15456"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15468"
msgid ""
"I'm really happy that I can spend so much time with Soran and Millay... "
"They are my little fluff monsters, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15480"
msgid "But can you believe I used to hate dogs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15492"
msgid "Really? That's a surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15504"
msgid "Yeah! I was, like, super afraid of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15516"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15528"
msgid ""
"Just seeing a dog on the other side of the street would have me running off "
"screaming! Even the cute ones..."
msgstr ""

